  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VDBA-Handicrafts Fashion Show Innovation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our group aims to improve Lao handicraft products for teenagers or middle-aged customers as a target market in order to promote thevalue and dignity of consuming cultural products made by Laotians themselves and increase employment, trade, and income generation.Aside from that, we also aim to present the people with disability-made products and create the stage for them to showcase their abilities, exchange their opinions, and introduce the hidden local handicraft products to everyone. We seek to overcome the issues of unemployment and the exclusion of people with disabilities in order to make sure that equality is always with us. We will improve our products by employing a professional and/or expert to teach our rightsholders to produce the handicrafts. We will ensure that our rightsholders benefit fully from the project, and that they have the opportunity to sell their products to earn more money, share their skills and knowledge with others, and continue the development of the Lao handicraft industry (the completed one will be replaced later)</narrative>
  </description>
