   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational Development for Blind Association (VDBA) is a host organization for Xonphao working group for People with Disabilities -the first prize winner of NOW-Us Awards Vol2.
Their mission:
&#x2022; To promote basic rights, gender and strengthening vocational development
&#x2022; Provide service with instruments and manual for training on different skills to blinded people.
&#x2022; Building training center for vocational skills development for the blinded people</narrative>
